{"ref":"BDB, אֲחִירָם","hw":"אֲחִירָם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִירָם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>brother of</em> (<em>the</em>) <em>lofty</em> = Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">חרם</span> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חִירָם\" href=\"/BDB,_חִירָם\", dir=\"rtl\">חִירָם</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אַבְרָם\" href=\"/BDB,_אַבְרָם\", dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִירָם</a><strong>)</strong> son of Benj. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:38\" href=\"/Numbers.26.38\">Nu 26:38</a> (prob. = <span dir=\"rtl\">אחרח</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.1\">1 Ch 8:1</a> v. Be) (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֵחִי\" href=\"/BDB,_אֵחִי\", dir=\"rtl\">אֵחִי וָרֹאשׁ</a> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:21\" href=\"/Genesis.46.21\">Gn 46:21</a>).","next":"BDB, חִירָם","prev":"BDB, אֲחִיקָם"}